{
  "uid": "chat-golden-signals",
  "title": "Chat Golden Signals",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Нагрузка, запросов/с",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"chat-rest\",method=\"GET\",uri=\"/api/profiles/{id}/activity\",status=~\"2..|5..\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "chat-rest",
          "refId": "A",
          "exemplar": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"chat-audit\",method=\"GET\",uri=\"/internal/audit/{profileId}\",status=~\"2..|5..\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "chat-audit",
          "refId": "B",
          "exemplar": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Доля 5xx",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "showPoints": "never",
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.2
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "chat:activity_error_ratio:rate1m",
          "legendFormat": "chat-rest",
          "refId": "A",
          "exemplar": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"chat-audit\",method=\"GET\",uri=\"/internal/audit/{profileId}\",status=~\"5..\"}[1m])) or (0 * sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"chat-audit\",method=\"GET\",uri=\"/internal/audit/{profileId}\"}[1m])))) / sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"chat-audit\",method=\"GET\",uri=\"/internal/audit/{profileId}\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "chat-audit",
          "refId": "B",
          "exemplar": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Задержка p95, только статус 200",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "showPoints": "never",
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{job=\"chat-rest\",method=\"GET\",uri=\"/api/profiles/{id}/activity\",status=\"200\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "chat-rest",
          "refId": "A",
          "exemplar": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{job=\"chat-audit\",method=\"GET\",uri=\"/internal/audit/{profileId}\",status=\"200\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "chat-audit",
          "refId": "B",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "SLI: 200 быстрее 500 мс, окно 5 минут",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "showPoints": "never",
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.995
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "chat:activity_good_ratio:rate5m",
          "legendFormat": "SLI",
          "refId": "A",
          "exemplar": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Скорость расхода бюджета ошибок (SLO 99,5 %)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(1 - chat:activity_good_ratio:rate5m) / 0.005",
          "legendFormat": "burn rate",
          "refId": "A",
          "exemplar": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Прикладной счётчик audit.activity.requests",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 16
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (result) (rate(audit_activity_requests_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{result}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "exemplar": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Насыщение: куча JVM и активные операции",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 16
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (job) (jvm_memory_used_bytes{area=\"heap\",job=~\"chat-gateway|chat-rest|chat-audit\"}) / sum by (job) (jvm_memory_max_bytes{area=\"heap\",job=~\"chat-gateway|chat-rest|chat-audit\"})",
          "legendFormat": "heap {{job}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "exemplar": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "audit_activity_active",
          "legendFormat": "active chat-audit",
          "refId": "B",
          "exemplar": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Логи с outcome=failure",
      "type": "logs",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "{job=\"course-apps\"} | json | outcome=\"failure\"",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Runbook",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Runbook: деградация активности профиля\n\nСимптом: `ChatActivityHighErrorRatio` или падение панели SLI.\n\n1. По панелям ниже определите тип деградации: рост 5xx или рост p95 при статусе 200.\n2. Сравните `chat-rest` и `chat-audit`. Если 5xx есть в обоих, причина ниже по цепочке. Если только в `chat-rest`, проверьте токен Keycloak и сеть до `chat-audit`.\n3. В Explore / Loki: `{job=\"course-apps\"} | json | outcome=\"failure\"`. Возьмите `requestId` и `traceId`.\n4. Откройте трассу в Tempo по `traceId` и найдите спан с ошибкой или основной задержкой.\n5. Проверьте режим: `scripts/set-diagnostic-mode.ps1 -Mode NORMAL` снимает учебный сбой. Для настоящего сбоя смотрите логи `chat-audit` и `/readyz`.\n6. Подтвердите восстановление: доля 5xx равна 0, SLI растёт, алерт перешёл в resolved.\n\nНе перезапускайте сервисы вслепую: перезапуск стирает состояние и не устраняет причину."
      }
    }
  ]
}
